  design.board_ports.VGA_VS: "The checker schema requires a drive style; push-pull is proposed for this active-high output, while the answer leaves its electrical drive style unspecified."
  raster_source.contract.resets.rst: "Use the specified CPU_RESETN reset port and represent asynchronous assertion with synchronized release using the available asynchronous reset style."
  median_filter.contract.resets.rst: "Use the specified CPU_RESETN reset port and represent asynchronous assertion with synchronized release using the available asynchronous reset style."
  video_output.contract.resets.rst: "Bind the module to the unchanged active-high synchronous rst_pix design reset."
  video_output.contract.ports.hsync: "Declare the output direction and one-bit width given in the answer; omit reset_value because the answer says it is not specified."
  video_output.contract.ports.vsync: "Retain the draft's output direction and reset value; no answer specifies a reset value or width for vsync."
